# Media origin for PRODUCTION builds only.
#
# Not a secret — this is a public bucket URL, and it must be committed because
# GitHub Actions runs the build and needs it. Vite only exposes VITE_-prefixed
# vars to client code, and only loads this file for `vite build`.
#
# Deliberately NOT set for local dev: src/lib/mediaManifest.js then falls back to
# the site's own BASE_URL and serves from public/projects/, so `npm run dev`
# works offline with no bucket at all.
#
# r2.dev is Cloudflare's development-grade endpoint and is rate-limited. Swap in
# a custom domain once the DNS zone moves to Cloudflare; nothing else changes.
VITE_MEDIA_BASE_URL=https://pub-67342d07ad21409f99f55162c3acdbef.r2.dev
